### 1. Test Auth endpoints
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{username}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Test Documents List (non authentifié)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents/

### 3. Test Documents List (authentifié)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents/
Authorization: Token {{authToken}}

### 4. Test Admin Interface
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/

### 5. Test API Root
GET http://localhost:8000/api/

### 6. Test Document Detail (remplacer {id} par un vrai ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents/1/
Authorization: Token {{authToken}}

### 7. Test Document Create
